 stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-139. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Clearing the Road · D-139.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · D-139. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 39, "id": 738, "rank": 24.00901, "firstReward": 355, "repeatReward": 168, "layoutSeed": 37306, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 139, "pressure": 2.489 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · D-140", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-140. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · D-140.", "letter": "Radio Silence · D-140. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 39, "id": 739, "rank": 24.04154, "firstReward": 355, "repeatReward": 168, "layoutSeed": 37343, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 140, "pressure": 2.491 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · D-141", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-141. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · D-141.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · D-141. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 37, "id": 740, "rank": 24.07407, "firstReward": 347, "repeatReward": 164, "layoutSeed": 37380, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 141, "pressure": 2.493 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · D-142", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-142. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Crates · D-142.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · D-142. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 37, "id": 741, "rank": 24.10661, "firstReward": 347, "repeatReward": 165, "layoutSeed": 37417, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 142, "pressure": 2.495 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · D-143", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-143. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Timber Convoy · D-143.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · D-143. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 42, "id": 742, "rank": 24.13914, "firstReward": 367, "repeatReward": 175, "layoutSeed": 37454, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 143, "pressure": 2.497 }, { "title": "Courier Route · D-144", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "marsh", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-144. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · D-144.", "letter": "Courier Route · D-144. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 42, "id": 743, "rank": 24.17167, "firstReward": 368, "repeatReward": 175, "layoutSeed": 37491, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 144, "pressure": 2.499 }, { "title": "The Riverbank Slope", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover unloading on the bank", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "Equipment crates are hard to haul up the slope. Belov organises a human chain from the water to the road. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover unloading on the bank.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Riverbank Slope” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Riverbank Slope.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 40, "id": 744, "rank": 24.2042, "firstReward": 360, "repeatReward": 171, "legacyId": 111, "layoutSeed": 111, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 145, "pressure": 2.501 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · D-146", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-146. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Repair Yard · D-146.", "letter": "Repair Yard · D-146. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 40, "id": 745, "rank": 24.23674, "firstReward": 360, "repeatReward": 171, "layoutSeed": 37565, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 146, "pressure": 2.503 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-147", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-147. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-147.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-147. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 38, "id": 746, "rank": 24.26927, "firstReward": 352, "repeatReward": 167, "layoutSeed": 37602, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 147, "pressure": 2.505 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · D-148", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-148. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · D-148.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · D-148. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 38, "id": 747, "rank": 24.3018, "firstReward": 352, "repeatReward": 167, "layoutSeed": 37639, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 148, "pressure": 2.507 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · D-149", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-149. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · D-149.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · D-149. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 43, "id": 748, "rank": 24.33433, "firstReward": 372, "repeatReward": 177, "layoutSeed": 37676, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 149, "pressure": 2.509 }, { "title": "Mill Road · D-150", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-150. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Mill Road · D-150.", "letter": "Mill Road · D-150. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 43, "id": 749, "rank": 24.36687, "firstReward": 373, "repeatReward": 177, "layoutSeed": 37713, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 150, "pressure": 2.511 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · D-151", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-151. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Assembly Point · D-151.", "letter": "Assembly Point · D-151. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 41, "id": 750, "rank": 24.3994, "firstReward": 365, "repeatReward": 173, "layoutSeed": 37750, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 151, "pressure": 2.513 }, { "title": "The Address Board", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "coast", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Defend the road to the assembly point", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "A board for finding relatives is put up at the temporary post. Nina leaves copies of several names from her notebook. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Defend the road to the assembly point.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Address Board.”", "letter": "“The Address Board.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 41, "id": 751, "rank": 24.43193, "firstReward": 365, "repeatReward": 173, "legacyId": 112, "layoutSeed": 112, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 152, "pressure": 2.515 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · D-153", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "coast", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-153. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Spare Parts Truck · D-153.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · D-153. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 39, "id": 752, "rank": 24.46446, "firstReward": 357, "repeatReward": 170, "layoutSeed": 37824, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 153, "pressure": 2.517 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-154", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "coast", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-154. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-154.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-154. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 39, "id": 753, "rank": 24.497, "firstReward": 357, "repeatReward": 170, "layoutSeed": 37861, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 154, "pressure": 2.519 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · D-155", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "coast", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-155. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Bridge Approach · D-155.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · D-155. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 37, "id": 754, "rank": 24.52953, "firstReward": 350, "repeatReward": 166, "layoutSeed": 37898, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 155, "pressure": 2.521 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · D-156", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "coast", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-156. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · D-156.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · D-156. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 38, "id": 755, "rank": 24.56206, "firstReward": 354, "repeatReward": 168, "layoutSeed": 37935, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 156, "pressure": 2.523 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · D-157", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "coast", "map": 19, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-157. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · D-157.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · D-157. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 43, "id": 756, "rank": 24.59459, "firstReward": 374, "repeatReward": 178, "layoutSeed": 37972, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 157, "pressure": 2.525 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · D-158", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "coast", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-158. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Supply Relay · D-158.", "letter": "Supply Relay · D-158. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 43, "id": 757, "rank": 24.62713, "firstReward": 374, "repeatReward": 178, "layoutSeed": 38009, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 158, "pressure": 2.527 }, { "title": "The New Footbridge", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Hold the exit from the crossing", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "The first light vehicles cross the decking. Sokolov keeps the defence in place until the last vehicle passes. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Hold the exit from the crossing.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The New Footbridge.”", "letter": "“The New Footbridge.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 41, "id": 758, "rank": 24.65966, "firstReward": 366, "repeatReward": 174, "legacyId": 113, "layoutSeed": 113, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 159, "pressure": 2.529 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · D-160", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-160. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · D-160.", "letter": "Radio Silence · D-160. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 39, "id": 759, "rank": 24.69219, "firstReward": 358, "repeatReward": 170, "layoutSeed": 38083, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 160, "pressure": 2.531 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · D-161", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-161. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · D-161.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · D-161. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 39, "id": 760, "rank": 24.72472, "firstReward": 359, "repeatReward": 170, "layoutSeed": 38120, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 161, "pressure": 2.533 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · D-162", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-162. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Crates · D-162.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · D-162. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 44, "id": 761, "rank": 24.75726, "firstReward": 379, "repeatReward": 180, "layoutSeed": 38157, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 162, "pressure": 2.535 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · D-163", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-163. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Timber Convoy · D-163.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · D-163. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 44, "id": 762, "rank": 24.78979, "firstReward": 379, "repeatReward": 180, "layoutSeed": 38194, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 163, "pressure": 2.537 }, { "title": "Courier Route · D-164", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-164. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · D-164.", "letter": "Courier Route · D-164. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 42, "id": 763, "rank": 24.82232, "firstReward": 371, "repeatReward": 177, "layoutSeed": 38231, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 164, "pressure": 2.539 }, { "title": "Water Pump · D-165", "place": "Dnieper Sector", "date": "September 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "river", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-165. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · D-165.", "letter": "Water Pump · D-165. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 42, "id": 764, "rank": 24.85485, "firstReward": 371, "repeatReward": 177, "layoutSeed": 38268, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 165, "pressure": 2.541 }, { "title": "Letters in the City", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Restored Communications Station", "quote": "“We have the address. Now to find the house.”", "story": "Communications are being restored in a retaken district. The company covers the approaches while signallers raise their lines. Nina finds an old address directory among surviving papers. The work is unfinished: the enemy is trying to regain the road junction.", "objective": "Protect the communications station from counterattacks.", "tip": "Starting supplies: +80. Build a strong position and upgrade it immediately.", "outro": "The station transmits its first civilian family-search request. For the first time, the airwaves carry more than military messages.", "letter": "One house still had its stairs, but no walls. Someone sat on a step waiting for their family.", "waves": 40, "id": 765, "rank": 24.88739, "firstReward": 363, "repeatReward": 173, "legacyId": 114, "layoutSeed": 114, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 166, "pressure": 2.543 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-167", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-167. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-167.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-167. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 40, "id": 766, "rank": 24.91992, "firstReward": 364, "repeatReward": 173, "layoutSeed": 38342, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 167, "pressure": 2.545 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · D-168", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector D-168. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · D-168.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · D-168. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 38, "id": 767, "rank": 24.95245, "firstReward": 356, "repeatReward": 169, "layoutSeed": 38379, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 168, "pressure": 2.547 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · D-169", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-169. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · D-169.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · D-169. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 38, "id": 768, "rank": 24.98498, "firstReward": 356, "repeatReward": 169, "layoutSeed": 38416, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 169, "pressure": 2.549 }, { "title": "Mill Road · D-170", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-170. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Mill Road · D-170.", "letter": "Mill Road · D-170. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 43, "id": 769, "rank": 25.01752, "firstReward": 376, "repeatReward": 179, "layoutSeed": 38453, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 170, "pressure": 2.551 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · D-171", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-171. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Assembly Point · D-171.", "letter": "Assembly Point · D-171. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 43, "id": 770, "rank": 25.05005, "firstReward": 376, "repeatReward": 179, "layoutSeed": 38490, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 171, "pressure": 2.553 }, { "title": "Observation Post · D-172", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 12, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-172. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · D-172.", "letter": "Observation Post · D-172. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 41, "id": 771, "rank": 25.08258, "firstReward": 368, "repeatReward": 175, "layoutSeed": 38527, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 172, "pressure": 2.555 }, { "title": "A House with a Number", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "elite", "base": "Cover the field postman's route", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "An address plate survives on a wall. Nina checks her notebook: one letter has finally found its street. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Cover the field postman's route.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “A House with a Number — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“A House with a Number.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 41, "id": 772, "rank": 25.11512, "firstReward": 369, "repeatReward": 175, "legacyId": 115, "layoutSeed": 115, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 173, "pressure": 2.557 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-174", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-174. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-174.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-174. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 39, "id": 773, "rank": 25.14765, "firstReward": 361, "repeatReward": 171, "layoutSeed": 38601, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 174, "pressure": 2.559 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · D-175", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector D-175. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Bridge Approach · D-175.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · D-175. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 39, "id": 774, "rank": 25.18018, "firstReward": 361, "repeatReward": 171, "layoutSeed": 38638, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 175, "pressure": 2.561 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · D-176", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-176. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · D-176.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · D-176. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 44, "id": 775, "rank": 25.21271, "firstReward": 381, "repeatReward": 182, "layoutSeed": 38675, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 176, "pressure": 2.563 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · D-177", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-177. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · D-177.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · D-177. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 44, "id": 776, "rank": 25.24525, "firstReward": 381, "repeatReward": 182, "layoutSeed": 38712, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 177, "pressure": 2.565 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · D-178", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-178. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Supply Relay · D-178.", "letter": "Supply Relay · D-178. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 42, "id": 777, "rank": 25.27778, "firstReward": 373, "repeatReward": 178, "layoutSeed": 38749, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 178, "pressure": 2.567 }, { "title": "The School Workshop", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "industrial", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Protect the road to the workshop", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A repair point opens in a classroom. Belov brings tools saved during the retreat. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Protect the road to the workshop.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The School Workshop” on their route map.", "letter": "“The School Workshop.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 42, "id": 778, "rank": 25.31031, "firstReward": 374, "repeatReward": 178, "legacyId": 116, "layoutSeed": 116, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 179, "pressure": 2.569 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · D-180", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "industrial", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-180. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · D-180.", "letter": "Radio Silence · D-180. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 40, "id": 779, "rank": 25.34284, "firstReward": 366, "repeatReward": 174, "layoutSeed": 38823, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 180, "pressure": 2.571 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · D-181", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "industrial", "map": 19, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-181. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Hospital Bend · D-181.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · D-181. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 40, "id": 780, "rank": 25.37538, "firstReward": 366, "repeatReward": 174, "layoutSeed": 38860, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 181, "pressure": 2.573 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · D-182", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "industrial", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector D-182. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Crates · D-182.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · D-182. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 39, "id": 781, "rank": 25.40791, "firstReward": 362, "repeatReward": 172, "layoutSeed": 38897, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 182, "pressure": 2.575 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · D-183", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "industrial", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-183. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Timber Convoy · D-183.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · D-183. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 39, "id": 782, "rank": 25.44044, "firstReward": 362, "repeatReward": 172, "layoutSeed": 38934, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 183, "pressure": 2.577 }, { "title": "Courier Route · D-184", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "industrial", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-184. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · D-184.", "letter": "Courier Route · D-184. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 44, "id": 783, "rank": 25.47297, "firstReward": 383, "repeatReward": 182, "layoutSeed": 38971, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 184, "pressure": 2.579 }, { "title": "Water Pump · D-185", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "industrial", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-185. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Water Pump · D-185.", "letter": "Water Pump · D-185. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 44, "id": 784, "rank": 25.50551, "firstReward": 383, "repeatReward": 182, "layoutSeed": 39008, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 185, "pressure": 2.581 }, { "title": "The Courtyard Well", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Keep the enemy out of the residential district", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Residents fetch water between alarms. Sokolov moves the defensive line away from the courtyard to the outer road. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Keep the enemy out of the residential district.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Courtyard Well” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Courtyard Well.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 42, "id": 785, "rank": 25.53804, "firstReward": 375, "repeatReward": 178, "legacyId": 117, "layoutSeed": 117, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 186, "pressure": 2.583 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · D-187", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-187. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Crossroads · D-187.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · D-187. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 42, "id": 786, "rank": 25.57057, "firstReward": 375, "repeatReward": 179, "layoutSeed": 39082, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 187, "pressure": 2.585 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · D-188", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 17, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-188. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · D-188.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · D-188. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 40, "id": 787, "rank": 25.6031, "firstReward": 367, "repeatReward": 175, "layoutSeed": 39119, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 188, "pressure": 2.587 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · D-189", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector D-189. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Sapper Patrol · D-189.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · D-189. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 40, "id": 788, "rank": 25.63564, "firstReward": 367, "repeatReward": 175, "layoutSeed": 39156, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 189, "pressure": 2.589 }, { "title": "Mill Road · D-190", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-190. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Mill Road · D-190.", "letter": "Mill Road · D-190. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 45, "id": 789, "rank": 25.66817, "firstReward": 388, "repeatReward": 185, "layoutSeed": 39193, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 190, "pressure": 2.591 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · D-191", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-191. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Assembly Point · D-191.", "letter": "Assembly Point · D-191. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 45, "id": 790, "rank": 25.7007, "firstReward": 388, "repeatReward": 185, "layoutSeed": 39230, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 191, "pressure": 2.593 }, { "title": "Observation Post · D-192", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "ruins", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-192. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · D-192.", "letter": "Observation Post · D-192. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 43, "id": 791, "rank": 25.73323, "firstReward": 380, "repeatReward": 181, "layoutSeed": 39267, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 192, "pressure": 2.595 }, { "title": "The Cleared Rubble", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Cover the road clearance", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "The passage into the district is almost clear. The company holds while the last beams are removed. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Cover the road clearance.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Cleared Rubble.”", "letter": "“The Cleared Rubble.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 43, "id": 792, "rank": 25.76577, "firstReward": 380, "repeatReward": 181, "legacyId": 118, "layoutSeed": 118, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 193, "pressure": 2.597 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · D-194", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-194. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Rations Depot · D-194.", "letter": "Rations Depot · D-194. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 41, "id": 793, "rank": 25.7983, "firstReward": 372, "repeatReward": 177, "layoutSeed": 39341, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 194, "pressure": 2.599 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · D-195", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-195. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Bridge Approach · D-195.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · D-195. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 39, "id": 794, "rank": 25.83083, "firstReward": 364, "repeatReward": 173, "layoutSeed": 39378, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 195, "pressure": 2.602 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · D-196", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector D-196. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · D-196.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · D-196. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 39, "id": 795, "rank": 25.86336, "firstReward": 365, "repeatReward": 173, "layoutSeed": 39415, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 196, "pressure": 2.604 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · D-197", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-197. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Field Kitchen · D-197.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · D-197. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 44, "id": 796, "rank": 25.8959, "firstReward": 385, "repeatReward": 183, "layoutSeed": 39452, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 197, "pressure": 2.606 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · D-198", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-198. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Supply Relay · D-198.", "letter": "Supply Relay · D-198. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 44, "id": 797, "rank": 25.92843, "firstReward": 385, "repeatReward": 184, "layoutSeed": 39489, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 198, "pressure": 2.608 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · D-199", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "village", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is returning along familiar routes. Old roads must be cleared again and protected against counterattacks. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector D-199. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Clearing the Road · D-199.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · D-199. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 42, "id": 798, "rank": 25.96096, "firstReward": 377, "repeatReward": 180, "layoutSeed": 39526, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 199, "pressure": 2.61 }, { "title": "The First Reply", "place": "Kyiv Sector", "date": "November 1943", "chapter": 3, "theme": "industrial", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Ensure the mail truck can leave", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Nina receives a short note: one rescued letter has been delivered. The promise of the first day now seems possible. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Ensure the mail truck can leave.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The First Reply.”", "letter": "“The First Reply.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 42, "id": 799, "rank": 25.99349, "firstReward": 377, "repeatReward": 180, "legacyId": 119, "layoutSeed": 119, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 200, "pressure": 2.612 }, { "title": "Forest Routes", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Fuel Column", "quote": "“This road is not on the old maps.”", "story": "During Operation Bagration, the company guards a forest supply route. Guides lead columns around broken roads. Wet woodland restricts visibility, and scattered enemy groups try to rejoin their lines across the fuel route.", "objective": "Hold the forest road for the supply column.", "tip": "Forest haze reduces range by 10%. Place weapons near several stretches of the route.", "outro": "Nina draws the new road over an old map. The mail truck passes, still wearing a patch on its left side.", "letter": "We saw the forests we left three years ago. Now we look at every bend differently.", "waves": 40, "id": 800, "rank": 26.02603, "firstReward": 369, "repeatReward": 176, "legacyId": 120, "layoutSeed": 120, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 1, "pressure": 2.614 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · E-002", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-002. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Sapper Patrol · E-002.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · E-002. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 40, "id": 801, "rank": 26.05856, "firstReward": 370, "repeatReward": 176, "layoutSeed": 39637, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 2, "pressure": 2.616 }, { "title": "Mill Road · E-003", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-003. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Mill Road · E-003.", "letter": "Mill Road · E-003. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 45, "id": 802, "rank": 26.09109, "firstReward": 390, "repeatReward": 186, "layoutSeed": 39674, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 3, "pressure": 2.618 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · E-004", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-004. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Assembly Point · E-004.", "letter": "Assembly Point · E-004. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 45, "id": 803, "rank": 26.12362, "firstReward": 390, "repeatReward": 186, "layoutSeed": 39711, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 4, "pressure": 2.62 }, { "title": "Observation Post · E-005", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-005. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · E-005.", "letter": "Observation Post · E-005. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 43, "id": 804, "rank": 26.15616, "firstReward": 382, "repeatReward": 182, "layoutSeed": 39748, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 5, "pressure": 2.622 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · E-006", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-006. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Spare Parts Truck · E-006.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · E-006. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 43, "id": 805, "rank": 26.18869, "firstReward": 382, "repeatReward": 182, "layoutSeed": 39785, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 6, "pressure": 2.624 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-007", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-007. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-007.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-007. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 41, "id": 806, "rank": 26.22122, "firstReward": 374, "repeatReward": 178, "layoutSeed": 39822, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 7, "pressure": 2.626 }, { "title": "The Forest Narrow Gauge", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Protect the forest rail crossing", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "An old narrow-gauge railway can carry heavy cargo. Belov checks the sleepers while the company covers the nearest crossing. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Protect the forest rail crossing.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Forest Narrow Gauge — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Forest Narrow Gauge.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 42, "id": 807, "rank": 26.25375, "firstReward": 379, "repeatReward": 180, "legacyId": 121, "layoutSeed": 121, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 8, "pressure": 2.628 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · E-009", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-009. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · E-009.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · E-009. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 40, "id": 808, "rank": 26.28629, "firstReward": 371, "repeatReward": 176, "layoutSeed": 39896, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 9, "pressure": 2.63 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · E-010", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-010. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Kitchen · E-010.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · E-010. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 40, "id": 809, "rank": 26.31882, "firstReward": 371, "repeatReward": 177, "layoutSeed": 39933, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 10, "pressure": 2.632 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · E-011", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-011. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Supply Relay · E-011.", "letter": "Supply Relay · E-011. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 45, "id": 810, "rank": 26.35135, "firstReward": 391, "repeatReward": 187, "layoutSeed": 39970, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 11, "pressure": 2.634 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · E-012", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-012. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Clearing the Road · E-012.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · E-012. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 45, "id": 811, "rank": 26.38388, "firstReward": 391, "repeatReward": 187, "layoutSeed": 40007, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 12, "pressure": 2.636 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · E-013", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-013. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · E-013.", "letter": "Radio Silence · E-013. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 43, "id": 812, "rank": 26.41642, "firstReward": 384, "repeatReward": 183, "layoutSeed": 40044, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 13, "pressure": 2.638 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-014", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-014. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-014.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-014. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 43, "id": 813, "rank": 26.44895, "firstReward": 384, "repeatReward": 183, "layoutSeed": 40081, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 14, "pressure": 2.64 }, { "title": "The Dry Clearing", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Defend the supply road", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "After the rain, only the clearing remains passable. Sokolov places the defences to keep it open for the wagons. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Defend the supply road.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Dry Clearing” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Dry Clearing.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 41, "id": 814, "rank": 26.48148, "firstReward": 376, "repeatReward": 179, "legacyId": 122, "layoutSeed": 122, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 15, "pressure": 2.642 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · E-016", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-016. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Timber Convoy · E-016.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · E-016. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 41, "id": 815, "rank": 26.51401, "firstReward": 376, "repeatReward": 179, "layoutSeed": 40155, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 16, "pressure": 2.644 }, { "title": "Courier Route · E-017", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-017. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · E-017.", "letter": "Courier Route · E-017. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 46, "id": 816, "rank": 26.54655, "firstReward": 396, "repeatReward": 189, "layoutSeed": 40192, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 17, "pressure": 2.646 }, { "title": "Water Pump · E-018", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-018. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Water Pump · E-018.", "letter": "Water Pump · E-018. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 46, "id": 817, "rank": 26.57908, "firstReward": 396, "repeatReward": 189, "layoutSeed": 40229, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 18, "pressure": 2.648 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · E-019", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 12, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-019. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Repair Yard · E-019.", "letter": "Repair Yard · E-019. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 44, "id": 818, "rank": 26.61161, "firstReward": 389, "repeatReward": 185, "layoutSeed": 40266, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 19, "pressure": 2.65 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · E-020", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-020. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Crossroads · E-020.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · E-020. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 42, "id": 819, "rank": 26.64414, "firstReward": 381, "repeatReward": 181, "layoutSeed": 40303, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 20, "pressure": 2.652 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · E-021", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-021. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · E-021.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · E-021. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 40, "id": 820, "rank": 26.67668, "firstReward": 373, "repeatReward": 178, "layoutSeed": 40340, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 21, "pressure": 2.654 }, { "title": "A Dispatch in a Bottle", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Cover the temporary radio post", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "A guide brings a note protected from the rain by glass. Nina copies it into the communications log. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Cover the temporary radio post.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “A Dispatch in a Bottle” to the company's story.", "letter": "“A Dispatch in a Bottle.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 40, "id": 821, "rank": 26.70921, "firstReward": 373, "repeatReward": 178, "legacyId": 123, "layoutSeed": 123, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 22, "pressure": 2.656 }, { "title": "Mill Road · E-023", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-023. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Mill Road · E-023.", "letter": "Mill Road · E-023. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 47, "id": 822, "rank": 26.74174, "firstReward": 401, "repeatReward": 192, "layoutSeed": 40414, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 23, "pressure": 2.658 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · E-024", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-024. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Assembly Point · E-024.", "letter": "Assembly Point · E-024. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 47, "id": 823, "rank": 26.77427, "firstReward": 401, "repeatReward": 192, "layoutSeed": 40451, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 24, "pressure": 2.66 }, { "title": "Observation Post · E-025", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-025. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · E-025.", "letter": "Observation Post · E-025. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 45, "id": 824, "rank": 26.80681, "firstReward": 394, "repeatReward": 188, "layoutSeed": 40488, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 25, "pressure": 2.662 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · E-026", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-026. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Spare Parts Truck · E-026.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · E-026. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 45, "id": 825, "rank": 26.83934, "firstReward": 394, "repeatReward": 188, "layoutSeed": 40525, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 26, "pressure": 2.664 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-027", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-027. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-027.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-027. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 43, "id": 826, "rank": 26.87187, "firstReward": 386, "repeatReward": 184, "layoutSeed": 40562, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 27, "pressure": 2.666 }, { "title": "The Forester's Map", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hold the forest road exit", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "A forester gives the company an old trail map. Belov marks where heavy vehicles can pass. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Hold the forest road exit.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Forester's Map.”", "letter": "“The Forester's Map.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 43, "id": 827, "rank": 26.9044, "firstReward": 386, "repeatReward": 184, "legacyId": 124, "layoutSeed": 124, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 28, "pressure": 2.668 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · E-029", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 17, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-029. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · E-029.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · E-029. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 41, "id": 828, "rank": 26.93694, "firstReward": 378, "repeatReward": 180, "layoutSeed": 40636, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 29, "pressure": 2.67 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · E-030", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-030. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Kitchen · E-030.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · E-030. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 41, "id": 829, "rank": 26.96947, "firstReward": 378, "repeatReward": 180, "layoutSeed": 40673, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 30, "pressure": 2.672 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · E-031", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-031. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Supply Relay · E-031.", "letter": "Supply Relay · E-031. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 39, "id": 830, "rank": 27.002, "firstReward": 371, "repeatReward": 176, "layoutSeed": 40710, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 31, "pressure": 2.674 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · E-032", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-032. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Clearing the Road · E-032.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · E-032. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 46, "id": 831, "rank": 27.03453, "firstReward": 399, "repeatReward": 190, "layoutSeed": 40747, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 32, "pressure": 2.676 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · E-033", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-033. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · E-033.", "letter": "Radio Silence · E-033. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 47, "id": 832, "rank": 27.06707, "firstReward": 403, "repeatReward": 193, "layoutSeed": 40784, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 33, "pressure": 2.678 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-034", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-034. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-034.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-034. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 45, "id": 833, "rank": 27.0996, "firstReward": 395, "repeatReward": 189, "layoutSeed": 40821, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 34, "pressure": 2.68 }, { "title": "The Field Archive", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "elite", "base": "Protect the departure of the archive copy", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Nina makes a second address list. She gives the first notebook to the driver of the next column. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Protect the departure of the archive copy.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Field Archive.”", "letter": "“The Field Archive.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 45, "id": 834, "rank": 27.13213, "firstReward": 395, "repeatReward": 189, "legacyId": 125, "layoutSeed": 125, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 35, "pressure": 2.682 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · E-036", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-036. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Timber Convoy · E-036.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · E-036. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 43, "id": 835, "rank": 27.16466, "firstReward": 387, "repeatReward": 185, "layoutSeed": 40895, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 36, "pressure": 2.684 }, { "title": "Courier Route · E-037", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-037. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · E-037.", "letter": "Courier Route · E-037. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 43, "id": 836, "rank": 27.1972, "firstReward": 388, "repeatReward": 185, "layoutSeed": 40932, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 37, "pressure": 2.686 }, { "title": "Water Pump · E-038", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-038. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Water Pump · E-038.", "letter": "Water Pump · E-038. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 41, "id": 837, "rank": 27.22973, "firstReward": 380, "repeatReward": 181, "layoutSeed": 40969, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 38, "pressure": 2.688 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · E-039", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-039. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Repair Yard · E-039.", "letter": "Repair Yard · E-039. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 41, "id": 838, "rank": 27.26226, "firstReward": 380, "repeatReward": 181, "layoutSeed": 41006, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 39, "pressure": 2.69 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · E-040", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 19, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-040. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Crossroads · E-040.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · E-040. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 48, "id": 839, "rank": 27.29479, "firstReward": 408, "repeatReward": 195, "layoutSeed": 41043, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 40, "pressure": 2.692 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · E-041", "place": "Belarusian Sector", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-041. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · E-041.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · E-041. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 48, "id": 840, "rank": 27.32733, "firstReward": 408, "repeatReward": 195, "layoutSeed": 41080, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 41, "pressure": 2.694 }, { "title": "The Berezina Crossing", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Supply Bridge", "quote": "“Rivers do not remember which way you travelled.”", "story": "The company strengthens a bridge for advancing units. Retreating enemy groups with vehicles approach along a side road. Sokolov separates the routes and keeps the combat road under fire. A jam must not disrupt the supply flow.", "objective": "Protect the bridge and keep supplies moving.", "tip": "Waves contain more transport. Use area damage, but keep guns for the armoured escorts.", "outro": "Belov posts a new load-limit sign on the bridge. Nina notices that, for once, it is a fresh board rather than a broken crate.", "letter": "I think more and more about the bridges I will build after the war. May only ordinary buses cross them.", "waves": 46, "id": 841, "rank": 27.35986, "firstReward": 401, "repeatReward": 191, "legacyId": 126, "layoutSeed": 126, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 42, "pressure": 2.696 }, { "title": "Mill Road · E-043", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-043. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Mill Road · E-043.", "letter": "Mill Road · E-043. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 46, "id": 842, "rank": 27.39239, "firstReward": 401, "repeatReward": 191, "layoutSeed": 41154, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 43, "pressure": 2.698 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · E-044", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-044. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Assembly Point · E-044.", "letter": "Assembly Point · E-044. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 44, "id": 843, "rank": 27.42492, "firstReward": 393, "repeatReward": 188, "layoutSeed": 41191, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 44, "pressure": 2.7 }, { "title": "Observation Post · E-045", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-045. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · E-045.", "letter": "Observation Post · E-045. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 44, "id": 844, "rank": 27.45746, "firstReward": 393, "repeatReward": 188, "layoutSeed": 41228, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 45, "pressure": 2.702 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · E-046", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-046. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Spare Parts Truck · E-046.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · E-046. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 42, "id": 845, "rank": 27.48999, "firstReward": 385, "repeatReward": 184, "layoutSeed": 41265, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 46, "pressure": 2.704 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-047", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-047. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-047.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-047. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 42, "id": 846, "rank": 27.52252, "firstReward": 385, "repeatReward": 184, "layoutSeed": 41302, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 47, "pressure": 2.706 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · E-048", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-048. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Bridge Approach · E-048.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · E-048. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 40, "id": 847, "rank": 27.55506, "firstReward": 378, "repeatReward": 180, "layoutSeed": 41339, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 48, "pressure": 2.708 }, { "title": "The Low Decking", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Defend the approaches to the bridge decking", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "The small bridge can support only light vehicles. Heavy loads are carried by hand while the company covers the bank. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the bridge decking.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Low Decking — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Low Decking.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 40, "id": 848, "rank": 27.58759, "firstReward": 378, "repeatReward": 180, "legacyId": 127, "layoutSeed": 127, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 49, "pressure": 2.71 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · E-050", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-050. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Kitchen · E-050.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · E-050. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 47, "id": 849, "rank": 27.62012, "firstReward": 406, "repeatReward": 194, "layoutSeed": 41413, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 50, "pressure": 2.712 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · E-051", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-051. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Supply Relay · E-051.", "letter": "Supply Relay · E-051. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 47, "id": 850, "rank": 27.65265, "firstReward": 406, "repeatReward": 194, "layoutSeed": 41450, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 51, "pressure": 2.714 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · E-052", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-052. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Clearing the Road · E-052.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · E-052. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 45, "id": 851, "rank": 27.68519, "firstReward": 398, "repeatReward": 190, "layoutSeed": 41487, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 52, "pressure": 2.716 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · E-053", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-053. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · E-053.", "letter": "Radio Silence · E-053. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 45, "id": 852, "rank": 27.71772, "firstReward": 398, "repeatReward": 190, "layoutSeed": 41524, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 53, "pressure": 2.718 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-054", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-054. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-054.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-054. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 43, "id": 853, "rank": 27.75025, "firstReward": 391, "repeatReward": 186, "layoutSeed": 41561, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 54, "pressure": 2.721 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · E-055", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 12, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-055. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Crates · E-055.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · E-055. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 43, "id": 854, "rank": 27.78278, "firstReward": 391, "repeatReward": 187, "layoutSeed": 41598, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 55, "pressure": 2.723 }, { "title": "The Mechanic's Boat", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Protect the loading point", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "A mechanic ferries tools across the river. His boat struggles to leave the shallows. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Protect the loading point.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Mechanic's Boat” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Mechanic's Boat.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 41, "id": 855, "rank": 27.81532, "firstReward": 383, "repeatReward": 183, "legacyId": 128, "layoutSeed": 128, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 56, "pressure": 2.725 }, { "title": "Courier Route · E-057", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-057. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · E-057.", "letter": "Courier Route · E-057. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 41, "id": 856, "rank": 27.84785, "firstReward": 383, "repeatReward": 183, "layoutSeed": 41672, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 57, "pressure": 2.727 }, { "title": "Water Pump · E-058", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-058. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Water Pump · E-058.", "letter": "Water Pump · E-058. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 48, "id": 857, "rank": 27.88038, "firstReward": 411, "repeatReward": 197, "layoutSeed": 41709, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 58, "pressure": 2.729 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · E-059", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-059. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Repair Yard · E-059.", "letter": "Repair Yard · E-059. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 49, "id": 858, "rank": 27.91291, "firstReward": 415, "repeatReward": 199, "layoutSeed": 41746, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 59, "pressure": 2.731 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · E-060", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-060. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Crossroads · E-060.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · E-060. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 47, "id": 859, "rank": 27.94545, "firstReward": 408, "repeatReward": 195, "layoutSeed": 41783, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 60, "pressure": 2.733 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · E-061", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-061. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · E-061.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · E-061. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 47, "id": 860, "rank": 27.97798, "firstReward": 408, "repeatReward": 195, "layoutSeed": 41820, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 61, "pressure": 2.735 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · E-062", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "marsh", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-062. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Sapper Patrol · E-062.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · E-062. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 45, "id": 861, "rank": 28.01051, "firstReward": 400, "repeatReward": 191, "layoutSeed": 41857, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 62, "pressure": 2.737 }, { "title": "The Communications Reel", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Cover the cable laying", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Engineers lay wire beside the crossing. Nina waits to join both banks on one channel. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Cover the cable laying.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Communications Reel” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Communications Reel.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 45, "id": 862, "rank": 28.04304, "firstReward": 400, "repeatReward": 191, "legacyId": 129, "layoutSeed": 129, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 63, "pressure": 2.739 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · E-064", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-064. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Assembly Point · E-064.", "letter": "Assembly Point · E-064. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 43, "id": 863, "rank": 28.07558, "firstReward": 392, "repeatReward": 187, "layoutSeed": 41931, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 64, "pressure": 2.741 }, { "title": "Observation Post · E-065", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 17, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-065. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · E-065.", "letter": "Observation Post · E-065. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 43, "id": 864, "rank": 28.10811, "firstReward": 392, "repeatReward": 187, "layoutSeed": 41968, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 65, "pressure": 2.743 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · E-066", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-066. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Spare Parts Truck · E-066.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · E-066. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 41, "id": 865, "rank": 28.14064, "firstReward": 385, "repeatReward": 183, "layoutSeed": 42005, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 66, "pressure": 2.745 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-067", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-067. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-067.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-067. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 48, "id": 866, "rank": 28.17317, "firstReward": 413, "repeatReward": 198, "layoutSeed": 42042, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 67, "pressure": 2.747 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · E-068", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-068. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Bridge Approach · E-068.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · E-068. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 48, "id": 867, "rank": 28.20571, "firstReward": 413, "repeatReward": 198, "layoutSeed": 42079, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 68, "pressure": 2.749 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · E-069", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-069. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · E-069.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · E-069. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 46, "id": 868, "rank": 28.23824, "firstReward": 405, "repeatReward": 194, "layoutSeed": 42116, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 69, "pressure": 2.751 }, { "title": "The River Signpost", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "coast", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "elite", "base": "Protect the traffic controllers at work", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "New markers are installed by the water. Sokolov must hold the road so vehicles stay on the safe route. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Protect the traffic controllers at work.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The River Signpost.”", "letter": "“The River Signpost.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 46, "id": 869, "rank": 28.27077, "firstReward": 405, "repeatReward": 194, "legacyId": 130, "layoutSeed": 130, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 70, "pressure": 2.753 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · E-071", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "coast", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-071. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Supply Relay · E-071.", "letter": "Supply Relay · E-071. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 44, "id": 870, "rank": 28.3033, "firstReward": 398, "repeatReward": 190, "layoutSeed": 42190, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 71, "pressure": 2.755 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · E-072", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "coast", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-072. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Clearing the Road · E-072.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · E-072. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 44, "id": 871, "rank": 28.33584, "firstReward": 398, "repeatReward": 190, "layoutSeed": 42227, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 72, "pressure": 2.757 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · E-073", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "coast", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-073. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · E-073.", "letter": "Radio Silence · E-073. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 42, "id": 872, "rank": 28.36837, "firstReward": 390, "repeatReward": 186, "layoutSeed": 42264, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 73, "pressure": 2.759 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-074", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "coast", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-074. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-074.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-074. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 42, "id": 873, "rank": 28.4009, "firstReward": 390, "repeatReward": 186, "layoutSeed": 42301, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 74, "pressure": 2.761 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · E-075", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "coast", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-075. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Crates · E-075.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · E-075. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 49, "id": 874, "rank": 28.43343, "firstReward": 418, "repeatReward": 200, "layoutSeed": 42338, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 75, "pressure": 2.763 }, { "title": "Mail on Both Banks", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the mail convoy as it divides", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "The letters split along different routes. Nina checks each bundle while Belov prepares the company to move. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the mail convoy as it divides.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “Mail on Both Banks.”", "letter": "“Mail on Both Banks.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 49, "id": 875, "rank": 28.46597, "firstReward": 418, "repeatReward": 200, "legacyId": 131, "layoutSeed": 131, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 76, "pressure": 2.765 }, { "title": "Courier Route · E-077", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-077. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · E-077.", "letter": "Courier Route · E-077. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 47, "id": 876, "rank": 28.4985, "firstReward": 411, "repeatReward": 196, "layoutSeed": 42412, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 77, "pressure": 2.767 }, { "title": "Water Pump · E-078", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-078. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Water Pump · E-078.", "letter": "Water Pump · E-078. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 47, "id": 877, "rank": 28.53103, "firstReward": 411, "repeatReward": 197, "layoutSeed": 42449, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 78, "pressure": 2.769 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · E-079", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-079. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Repair Yard · E-079.", "letter": "Repair Yard · E-079. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 45, "id": 878, "rank": 28.56356, "firstReward": 403, "repeatReward": 193, "layoutSeed": 42486, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 79, "pressure": 2.771 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · E-080", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-080. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Crossroads · E-080.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · E-080. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 45, "id": 879, "rank": 28.5961, "firstReward": 403, "repeatReward": 193, "layoutSeed": 42523, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 80, "pressure": 2.773 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · E-081", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-081. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · E-081.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · E-081. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 43, "id": 880, "rank": 28.62863, "firstReward": 395, "repeatReward": 189, "layoutSeed": 42560, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 81, "pressure": 2.775 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · E-082", "place": "Belarus", "date": "June 1944", "chapter": 4, "theme": "river", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-082. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Sapper Patrol · E-082.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · E-082. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 43, "id": 881, "rank": 28.66116, "firstReward": 395, "repeatReward": 189, "layoutSeed": 42597, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 82, "pressure": 2.777 }, { "title": "The Long Road", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Supply Node", "quote": "“The war's end is not yet in sight. But we know how to wait for it.”", "story": "Months of marching have changed the company, but the mail truck stays beside it. On the Vistula front, Sokolov covers a supply junction for a new advance. Roads are icy, and enemy heavy vehicles can still cut stretched supply lines.", "objective": "Keep the winter supply junction from being cut off.", "tip": "Frost slows enemies by 8%. In later waves, combine slowing effects with level-three guns.", "outro": "Only a few old letters remain in Nina's bag. One is still the unaddressed letter to Vera.", "letter": "We have travelled so far that I fear forgetting the way home. Thankfully, the letters still know it.", "waves": 41, "id": 882, "rank": 28.69369, "firstReward": 388, "repeatReward": 185, "legacyId": 132, "layoutSeed": 132, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 83, "pressure": 2.779 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · E-084", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-084. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Assembly Point · E-084.", "letter": "Assembly Point · E-084. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 41, "id": 883, "rank": 28.72623, "firstReward": 388, "repeatReward": 185, "layoutSeed": 42671, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 84, "pressure": 2.781 }, { "title": "Observation Post · E-085", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-085. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · E-085.", "letter": "Observation Post · E-085. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 49, "id": 884, "rank": 28.75876, "firstReward": 420, "repeatReward": 201, "layoutSeed": 42708, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 85, "pressure": 2.783 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · E-086", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-086. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Spare Parts Truck · E-086.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · E-086. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 49, "id": 885, "rank": 28.79129, "firstReward": 420, "repeatReward": 201, "layoutSeed": 42745, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 86, "pressure": 2.785 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-087", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-087. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-087.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-087. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 47, "id": 886, "rank": 28.82382, "firstReward": 412, "repeatReward": 197, "layoutSeed": 42782, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 87, "pressure": 2.787 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · E-088", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-088. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Bridge Approach · E-088.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · E-088. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 47, "id": 887, "rank": 28.85636, "firstReward": 412, "repeatReward": 197, "layoutSeed": 42819, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 88, "pressure": 2.789 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · E-089", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-089. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · E-089.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · E-089. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 45, "id": 888, "rank": 28.88889, "firstReward": 405, "repeatReward": 194, "layoutSeed": 42856, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 89, "pressure": 2.791 }, { "title": "The Small Station", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Protect the station communications node", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "Nobody at the station knows the convoy's new route. Nina pieces scattered messages into one clear order. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Protect the station communications node.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Small Station — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Small Station.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 45, "id": 889, "rank": 28.92142, "firstReward": 405, "repeatReward": 194, "legacyId": 133, "layoutSeed": 133, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 90, "pressure": 2.793 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · E-091", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-091. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Supply Relay · E-091.", "letter": "Supply Relay · E-091. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 43, "id": 890, "rank": 28.95395, "firstReward": 397, "repeatReward": 190, "layoutSeed": 42930, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 91, "pressure": 2.795 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · E-092", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 10, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-092. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Clearing the Road · E-092.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · E-092. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 43, "id": 891, "rank": 28.98649, "firstReward": 397, "repeatReward": 190, "layoutSeed": 42967, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 92, "pressure": 2.797 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · E-093", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-093. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · E-093.", "letter": "Radio Silence · E-093. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 50, "id": 892, "rank": 29.01902, "firstReward": 425, "repeatReward": 204, "layoutSeed": 43004, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 93, "pressure": 2.799 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-094", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-094. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-094.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-094. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 50, "id": 893, "rank": 29.05155, "firstReward": 425, "repeatReward": 204, "layoutSeed": 43041, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 94, "pressure": 2.801 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · E-095", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-095. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Crates · E-095.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · E-095. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 48, "id": 894, "rank": 29.08408, "firstReward": 418, "repeatReward": 200, "layoutSeed": 43078, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 95, "pressure": 2.803 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · E-096", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-096. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Timber Convoy · E-096.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · E-096. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 48, "id": 895, "rank": 29.11662, "firstReward": 418, "repeatReward": 200, "layoutSeed": 43115, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 96, "pressure": 2.805 }, { "title": "The Warm Carriage", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Defend the approach to the train", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Wounded people travel in a heated carriage. Belov checks the stove fuel and stays to cover the route. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Defend the approach to the train.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Warm Carriage” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Warm Carriage.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 46, "id": 896, "rank": 29.14915, "firstReward": 410, "repeatReward": 196, "legacyId": 134, "layoutSeed": 134, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 97, "pressure": 2.807 }, { "title": "Water Pump · E-098", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 10, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-098. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Water Pump · E-098.", "letter": "Water Pump · E-098. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 46, "id": 897, "rank": 29.18168, "firstReward": 410, "repeatReward": 196, "layoutSeed": 43189, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 98, "pressure": 2.809 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · E-099", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-099. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Repair Yard · E-099.", "letter": "Repair Yard · E-099. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 44, "id": 898, "rank": 29.21421, "firstReward": 402, "repeatReward": 192, "layoutSeed": 43226, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 99, "pressure": 2.811 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · E-100", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-100. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Crossroads · E-100.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · E-100. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 44, "id": 899, "rank": 29.24675, "firstReward": 403, "repeatReward": 192, "layoutSeed": 43263, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 100, "pressure": 2.813 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · E-101", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-101. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · E-101.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · E-101. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 42, "id": 900, "rank": 29.27928, "firstReward": 395, "repeatReward": 189, "layoutSeed": 43300, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 101, "pressure": 2.815 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · E-102", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-102. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Sapper Patrol · E-102.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · E-102. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 42, "id": 901, "rank": 29.31181, "firstReward": 395, "repeatReward": 189, "layoutSeed": 43337, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 102, "pressure": 2.817 }, { "title": "Mill Road · E-103", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 13, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-103. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Mill Road · E-103.", "letter": "Mill Road · E-103. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 49, "id": 902, "rank": 29.34434, "firstReward": 423, "repeatReward": 203, "layoutSeed": 43374, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 103, "pressure": 2.819 }, { "title": "The Black Ribbon of Road", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "elite", "base": "Hold the cleared route", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "A cleared strip darkens the snow. Sokolov knows their own column will not be the only one to use it. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the cleared route.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Black Ribbon of Road” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Black Ribbon of Road.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 47, "id": 903, "rank": 29.37688, "firstReward": 415, "repeatReward": 199, "legacyId": 135, "layoutSeed": 135, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 104, "pressure": 2.821 }, { "title": "Observation Post · E-105", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-105. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · E-105.", "letter": "Observation Post · E-105. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 47, "id": 904, "rank": 29.40941, "firstReward": 415, "repeatReward": 199, "layoutSeed": 43448, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 105, "pressure": 2.823 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · E-106", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-106. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Spare Parts Truck · E-106.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · E-106. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 45, "id": 905, "rank": 29.44194, "firstReward": 408, "repeatReward": 195, "layoutSeed": 43485, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 106, "pressure": 2.825 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-107", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-107. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-107.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-107. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 45, "id": 906, "rank": 29.47447, "firstReward": 408, "repeatReward": 195, "layoutSeed": 43522, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 107, "pressure": 2.827 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · E-108", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 15, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-108. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Bridge Approach · E-108.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · E-108. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 43, "id": 907, "rank": 29.50701, "firstReward": 400, "repeatReward": 191, "layoutSeed": 43559, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 108, "pressure": 2.829 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · E-109", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-109. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · E-109.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · E-109. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 43, "id": 908, "rank": 29.53954, "firstReward": 400, "repeatReward": 191, "layoutSeed": 43596, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 109, "pressure": 2.831 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · E-110", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-110. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Kitchen · E-110.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · E-110. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 50, "id": 909, "rank": 29.57207, "firstReward": 428, "repeatReward": 205, "layoutSeed": 43633, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 110, "pressure": 2.833 }, { "title": "A Supply of Glass", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the supply convoy", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "Fragile cargo is being carried for instrument repairs. The vehicles move slowly, forcing the company to remain at the line. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the supply convoy.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “A Supply of Glass.”", "letter": "“A Supply of Glass.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 50, "id": 910, "rank": 29.6046, "firstReward": 428, "repeatReward": 205, "legacyId": 136, "layoutSeed": 136, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 111, "pressure": 2.835 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · E-112", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 7, "weather": "snow", "trait": "mud", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-112. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Clearing the Road · E-112.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · E-112. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 49, "id": 911, "rank": 29.63714, "firstReward": 425, "repeatReward": 204, "layoutSeed": 43707, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 112, "pressure": 2.838 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · E-113", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-113. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · E-113.", "letter": "Radio Silence · E-113. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 49, "id": 912, "rank": 29.66967, "firstReward": 425, "repeatReward": 204, "layoutSeed": 43744, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 113, "pressure": 2.84 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-114", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 15, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-114. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-114.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-114. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 47, "id": 913, "rank": 29.7022, "firstReward": 417, "repeatReward": 200, "layoutSeed": 43781, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 114, "pressure": 2.842 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · E-115", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-115. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Crates · E-115.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · E-115. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 47, "id": 914, "rank": 29.73473, "firstReward": 417, "repeatReward": 200, "layoutSeed": 43818, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 115, "pressure": 2.844 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · E-116", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-116. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Timber Convoy · E-116.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · E-116. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 45, "id": 915, "rank": 29.76727, "firstReward": 409, "repeatReward": 196, "layoutSeed": 43855, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 116, "pressure": 2.846 }, { "title": "Courier Route · E-117", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-117. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · E-117.", "letter": "Courier Route · E-117. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 45, "id": 916, "rank": 29.7998, "firstReward": 409, "repeatReward": 196, "layoutSeed": 43892, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 117, "pressure": 2.848 }, { "title": "An Address in Two Languages", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Protect the letter handover point", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "A postman helps Nina read unfamiliar writing on an envelope. It is another step towards keeping her promise. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Protect the letter handover point.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “An Address in Two Languages.”", "letter": "“An Address in Two Languages.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 43, "id": 917, "rank": 29.83233, "firstReward": 402, "repeatReward": 192, "legacyId": 137, "layoutSeed": 137, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 118, "pressure": 2.85 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · E-119", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-119. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Repair Yard · E-119.", "letter": "Repair Yard · E-119. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 43, "id": 918, "rank": 29.86486, "firstReward": 402, "repeatReward": 192, "layoutSeed": 43967, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 119, "pressure": 2.852 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · E-120", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-120. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Crossroads · E-120.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · E-120. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 50, "id": 919, "rank": 29.8974, "firstReward": 430, "repeatReward": 206, "layoutSeed": 44003, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 120, "pressure": 2.854 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · E-121", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-121. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · E-121.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · E-121. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 50, "id": 920, "rank": 29.92993, "firstReward": 430, "repeatReward": 206, "layoutSeed": 44040, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 121, "pressure": 2.856 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · E-122", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-122. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Sapper Patrol · E-122.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · E-122. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 48, "id": 921, "rank": 29.96246, "firstReward": 422, "repeatReward": 202, "layoutSeed": 44077, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 122, "pressure": 2.858 }, { "title": "Mill Road · E-123", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-123. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Mill Road · E-123.", "letter": "Mill Road · E-123. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 48, "id": 922, "rank": 29.99499, "firstReward": 422, "repeatReward": 202, "layoutSeed": 44114, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 123, "pressure": 2.86 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · E-124", "place": "Vistula Sector", "date": "January 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-124. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Assembly Point · E-124.", "letter": "Assembly Point · E-124. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 46, "id": 923, "rank": 30.02753, "firstReward": 415, "repeatReward": 199, "layoutSeed": 44151, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 124, "pressure": 2.862 }, { "title": "Before the Last City", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "elite", "base": "Field Crossing", "quote": "“Do not hurry to die. We still have to go home.”", "story": "The company holds the approach to a crossing before the final battles. Sokolov tells the recruits to stay alert: a nearing end does not make war safer. Belov inspects the defences. Nina hands Vera's letter to a new runner who recognises a neighbour's handwriting.", "objective": "Hold the crossing against reinforced groups.", "tip": "Enemies have 12% more health. Keep supplies in reserve: repairing the defence can save the mission.", "outro": "The runner returns with an address. Vera is alive. For the first time, Nina places the letter in outgoing mail rather than back in the bag.", "letter": "The letter has found its way. I thought I was guarding someone else's hope. All these years, it was guarding me.", "waves": 46, "id": 924, "rank": 30.06006, "firstReward": 415, "repeatReward": 199, "legacyId": 138, "layoutSeed": 138, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 125, "pressure": 2.864 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · E-126", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-126. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Spare Parts Truck · E-126.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · E-126. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 44, "id": 925, "rank": 30.09259, "firstReward": 407, "repeatReward": 195, "layoutSeed": 44225, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 126, "pressure": 2.866 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-127", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-127. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-127.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-127. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 44, "id": 926, "rank": 30.12513, "firstReward": 407, "repeatReward": 195, "layoutSeed": 44262, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 127, "pressure": 2.868 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · E-128", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-128. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Bridge Approach · E-128.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · E-128. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 50, "id": 927, "rank": 30.15766, "firstReward": 431, "repeatReward": 207, "layoutSeed": 44299, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 128, "pressure": 2.87 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · E-129", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-129. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · E-129.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · E-129. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 50, "id": 928, "rank": 30.19019, "firstReward": 432, "repeatReward": 207, "layoutSeed": 44336, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 129, "pressure": 2.872 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · E-130", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-130. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Kitchen · E-130.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · E-130. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 49, "id": 929, "rank": 30.22272, "firstReward": 428, "repeatReward": 205, "layoutSeed": 44373, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 130, "pressure": 2.874 }, { "title": "The Canal Workshop", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Protect the repair base approach", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "A repair point by the canal takes the last damaged vehicles. Sokolov covers the road leading there. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Protect the repair base approach.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Canal Workshop — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Canal Workshop.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 49, "id": 930, "rank": 30.25526, "firstReward": 428, "repeatReward": 205, "legacyId": 139, "layoutSeed": 139, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 131, "pressure": 2.876 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · E-132", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-132. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Clearing the Road · E-132.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · E-132. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 47, "id": 931, "rank": 30.28779, "firstReward": 420, "repeatReward": 201, "layoutSeed": 44447, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 132, "pressure": 2.878 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · E-133", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-133. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · E-133.", "letter": "Radio Silence · E-133. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 47, "id": 932, "rank": 30.32032, "firstReward": 420, "repeatReward": 201, "layoutSeed": 44484, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 133, "pressure": 2.88 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-134", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-134. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-134.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-134. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 45, "id": 933, "rank": 30.35285, "firstReward": 412, "repeatReward": 197, "layoutSeed": 44521, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 134, "pressure": 2.882 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · E-135", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-135. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Crates · E-135.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · E-135. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 45, "id": 934, "rank": 30.38539, "firstReward": 413, "repeatReward": 198, "layoutSeed": 44558, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 135, "pressure": 2.884 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · E-136", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-136. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Timber Convoy · E-136.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · E-136. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 44, "id": 935, "rank": 30.41792, "firstReward": 409, "repeatReward": 196, "layoutSeed": 44595, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 136, "pressure": 2.886 }, { "title": "Courier Route · E-137", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-137. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · E-137.", "letter": "Courier Route · E-137. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 44, "id": 936, "rank": 30.45045, "firstReward": 409, "repeatReward": 196, "layoutSeed": 44632, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 137, "pressure": 2.888 }, { "title": "The Stone Overpass", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "elite", "base": "Hold the road before the overpass", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Wagons pass beneath the overpass. Belov chooses positions to keep the enemy away from the narrow passage. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the road before the overpass.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Stone Overpass” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Stone Overpass.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 50, "id": 937, "rank": 30.48298, "firstReward": 433, "repeatReward": 208, "legacyId": 140, "layoutSeed": 140, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 138, "pressure": 2.89 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · E-139", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 12, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-139. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Repair Yard · E-139.", "letter": "Repair Yard · E-139. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 49, "id": 938, "rank": 30.51552, "firstReward": 429, "repeatReward": 206, "layoutSeed": 44706, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 139, "pressure": 2.892 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · E-140", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-140. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Crossroads · E-140.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · E-140. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 49, "id": 939, "rank": 30.54805, "firstReward": 429, "repeatReward": 206, "layoutSeed": 44743, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 140, "pressure": 2.894 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · E-141", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-141. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · E-141.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · E-141. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 47, "id": 940, "rank": 30.58058, "firstReward": 422, "repeatReward": 202, "layoutSeed": 44780, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 141, "pressure": 2.896 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · E-142", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 19, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-142. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Sapper Patrol · E-142.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · E-142. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 47, "id": 941, "rank": 30.61311, "firstReward": 422, "repeatReward": 202, "layoutSeed": 44817, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 142, "pressure": 2.898 }, { "title": "Mill Road · E-143", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-143. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Mill Road · E-143.", "letter": "Mill Road · E-143. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 45, "id": 942, "rank": 30.64565, "firstReward": 414, "repeatReward": 198, "layoutSeed": 44854, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 143, "pressure": 2.9 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · E-144", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "autumn", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-144. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Assembly Point · E-144.", "letter": "Assembly Point · E-144. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 45, "id": 943, "rank": 30.67818, "firstReward": 414, "repeatReward": 198, "layoutSeed": 44891, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 144, "pressure": 2.902 }, { "title": "The Medics' White Flag", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the evacuation route", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A medical team asks for time to evacuate people. Sokolov delays the move rather than leave the road open. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the evacuation route.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Medics' White Flag” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Medics' White Flag.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 50, "id": 944, "rank": 30.71071, "firstReward": 434, "repeatReward": 208, "legacyId": 141, "layoutSeed": 141, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 145, "pressure": 2.904 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · E-146", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-146. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Spare Parts Truck · E-146.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · E-146. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 50, "id": 945, "rank": 30.74324, "firstReward": 434, "repeatReward": 209, "layoutSeed": 44965, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 146, "pressure": 2.906 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-147", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-147. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-147.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-147. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 50, "id": 946, "rank": 30.77578, "firstReward": 435, "repeatReward": 209, "layoutSeed": 45002, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 147, "pressure": 2.908 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · E-148", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-148. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Bridge Approach · E-148.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · E-148. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 50, "id": 947, "rank": 30.80831, "firstReward": 435, "repeatReward": 209, "layoutSeed": 45039, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 148, "pressure": 2.91 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · E-149", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 17, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-149. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · E-149.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · E-149. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 48, "id": 948, "rank": 30.84084, "firstReward": 427, "repeatReward": 205, "layoutSeed": 45076, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 149, "pressure": 2.912 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · E-150", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-150. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Kitchen · E-150.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · E-150. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 48, "id": 949, "rank": 30.87337, "firstReward": 427, "repeatReward": 205, "layoutSeed": 45113, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 150, "pressure": 2.914 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · E-151", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-151. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Supply Relay · E-151.", "letter": "Supply Relay · E-151. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 46, "id": 950, "rank": 30.90591, "firstReward": 419, "repeatReward": 201, "layoutSeed": 45150, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 151, "pressure": 2.916 }, { "title": "A Key to an Empty House", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Defend the field mail point", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "A small key and a note lie in the mailbag. Nina copies the address and promises to deliver them with the letter. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Defend the field mail point.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “A Key to an Empty House.”", "letter": "“A Key to an Empty House.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 46, "id": 951, "rank": 30.93844, "firstReward": 419, "repeatReward": 201, "legacyId": 142, "layoutSeed": 142, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 152, "pressure": 2.918 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · E-153", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-153. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Radio Silence · E-153.", "letter": "Radio Silence · E-153. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 44, "id": 952, "rank": 30.97097, "firstReward": 412, "repeatReward": 197, "layoutSeed": 45224, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 153, "pressure": 2.92 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-154", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-154. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-154.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-154. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 44, "id": 953, "rank": 31.0035, "firstReward": 412, "repeatReward": 197, "layoutSeed": 45261, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 154, "pressure": 2.922 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · E-155", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 17, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-155. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Crates · E-155.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · E-155. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 50, "id": 954, "rank": 31.03604, "firstReward": 436, "repeatReward": 209, "layoutSeed": 45298, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 155, "pressure": 2.924 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · E-156", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-156. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Timber Convoy · E-156.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · E-156. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 50, "id": 955, "rank": 31.06857, "firstReward": 436, "repeatReward": 209, "layoutSeed": 45335, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 156, "pressure": 2.926 }, { "title": "Courier Route · E-157", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-157. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · E-157.", "letter": "Courier Route · E-157. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 49, "id": 956, "rank": 31.1011, "firstReward": 432, "repeatReward": 207, "layoutSeed": 45372, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 157, "pressure": 2.928 }, { "title": "Water Pump · E-158", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "mud", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-158. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Water Pump · E-158.", "letter": "Water Pump · E-158. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 49, "id": 957, "rank": 31.13363, "firstReward": 433, "repeatReward": 208, "layoutSeed": 45409, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 158, "pressure": 2.93 }, { "title": "The Night Before the Road", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Cover preparations for the last column", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "Belov counts the tools that began this journey with them. Almost every one now carries somebody's story. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Cover preparations for the last column.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Night Before the Road.”", "letter": "“The Night Before the Road.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 47, "id": 958, "rank": 31.16617, "firstReward": 425, "repeatReward": 204, "legacyId": 143, "layoutSeed": 143, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 159, "pressure": 2.932 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · E-160", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 19, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-160. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Crossroads · E-160.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · E-160. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 47, "id": 959, "rank": 31.1987, "firstReward": 425, "repeatReward": 204, "layoutSeed": 45483, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 160, "pressure": 2.934 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · E-161", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-161. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · E-161.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · E-161. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 45, "id": 960, "rank": 31.23123, "firstReward": 417, "repeatReward": 200, "layoutSeed": 45520, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 161, "pressure": 2.936 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · E-162", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-162. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Sapper Patrol · E-162.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · E-162. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 46, "id": 961, "rank": 31.26376, "firstReward": 421, "repeatReward": 202, "layoutSeed": 45557, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 162, "pressure": 2.938 }, { "title": "Mill Road · E-163", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-163. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Mill Road · E-163.", "letter": "Mill Road · E-163. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 50, "id": 962, "rank": 31.2963, "firstReward": 437, "repeatReward": 210, "layoutSeed": 45594, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 163, "pressure": 2.94 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · E-164", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-164. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Assembly Point · E-164.", "letter": "Assembly Point · E-164. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 50, "id": 963, "rank": 31.32883, "firstReward": 438, "repeatReward": 210, "layoutSeed": 45631, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 164, "pressure": 2.942 }, { "title": "Observation Post · E-165", "place": "Oder Sector", "date": "April 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "forest", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-165. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · E-165.", "letter": "Observation Post · E-165. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 50, "id": 964, "rank": 31.36136, "firstReward": 438, "repeatReward": 210, "layoutSeed": 45668, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 165, "pressure": 2.944 }, { "title": "The Surviving Print Shop", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "elite", "base": "Protect the print shop approach", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Nina finds paper for new address lists. A hand press starts while Sokolov holds the road. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Protect the print shop approach.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Surviving Print Shop — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Surviving Print Shop.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 50, "id": 965, "rank": 31.39389, "firstReward": 438, "repeatReward": 210, "legacyId": 144, "layoutSeed": 144, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 166, "pressure": 2.946 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-167", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 16, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-167. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-167.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-167. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 49, "id": 966, "rank": 31.42643, "firstReward": 434, "repeatReward": 208, "layoutSeed": 45742, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 167, "pressure": 2.948 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · E-168", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector E-168. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Bridge Approach · E-168.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · E-168. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 49, "id": 967, "rank": 31.45896, "firstReward": 434, "repeatReward": 208, "layoutSeed": 45779, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 168, "pressure": 2.95 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · E-169", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 12, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-169. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · E-169.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · E-169. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 47, "id": 968, "rank": 31.49149, "firstReward": 426, "repeatReward": 205, "layoutSeed": 45816, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 169, "pressure": 2.952 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · E-170", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 22, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-170. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Kitchen · E-170.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · E-170. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 47, "id": 969, "rank": 31.52402, "firstReward": 427, "repeatReward": 205, "layoutSeed": 45853, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 170, "pressure": 2.954 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · E-171", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 8, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-171. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Supply Relay · E-171.", "letter": "Supply Relay · E-171. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 45, "id": 970, "rank": 31.55656, "firstReward": 419, "repeatReward": 201, "layoutSeed": 45890, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 171, "pressure": 2.957 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · E-172", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 18, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-172. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Clearing the Road · E-172.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · E-172. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 45, "id": 971, "rank": 31.58909, "firstReward": 419, "repeatReward": 201, "layoutSeed": 45927, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 172, "pressure": 2.959 }, { "title": "Paving Stones After Rain", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the ambulance convoy", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "Wet stones reflect the ambulance headlights. Belov deploys his crews at the bend and clears a way for the vehicles. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the ambulance convoy.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “Paving Stones After Rain” on their route map.", "letter": "“Paving Stones After Rain.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 50, "id": 972, "rank": 31.62162, "firstReward": 439, "repeatReward": 211, "legacyId": 145, "layoutSeed": 145, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 173, "pressure": 2.961 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-174", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-174. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-174.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-174. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 50, "id": 973, "rank": 31.65415, "firstReward": 439, "repeatReward": 211, "layoutSeed": 46001, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 174, "pressure": 2.963 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · E-175", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 12, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector E-175. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Crates · E-175.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · E-175. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 50, "id": 974, "rank": 31.68669, "firstReward": 439, "repeatReward": 211, "layoutSeed": 46038, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 175, "pressure": 2.965 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · E-176", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 22, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-176. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Timber Convoy · E-176.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · E-176. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 48, "id": 975, "rank": 31.71922, "firstReward": 432, "repeatReward": 207, "layoutSeed": 46075, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 176, "pressure": 2.967 }, { "title": "Courier Route · E-177", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 8, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-177. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · E-177.", "letter": "Courier Route · E-177. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 48, "id": 976, "rank": 31.75175, "firstReward": 432, "repeatReward": 207, "layoutSeed": 46112, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 177, "pressure": 2.969 }, { "title": "Water Pump · E-178", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 18, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-178. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Water Pump · E-178.", "letter": "Water Pump · E-178. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 46, "id": 977, "rank": 31.78428, "firstReward": 424, "repeatReward": 203, "layoutSeed": 46149, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 178, "pressure": 2.971 }, { "title": "The Bag with Red Thread", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 8, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Defend the field communications node", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "The same mailbag lies beside the radio. Nina checks the last unsent bundle. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Defend the field communications node.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Bag with Red Thread” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Bag with Red Thread.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 46, "id": 978, "rank": 31.81682, "firstReward": 424, "repeatReward": 203, "legacyId": 146, "layoutSeed": 146, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 179, "pressure": 2.973 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · E-180", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 14, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-180. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Crossroads · E-180.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · E-180. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 50, "id": 979, "rank": 31.84935, "firstReward": 440, "repeatReward": 211, "layoutSeed": 46223, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 180, "pressure": 2.975 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · E-181", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 1, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-181. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Wire through the Woods · E-181.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · E-181. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 50, "id": 980, "rank": 31.88188, "firstReward": 440, "repeatReward": 212, "layoutSeed": 46260, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 181, "pressure": 2.977 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · E-182", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 11, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector E-182. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Sapper Patrol · E-182.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · E-182. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 50, "id": 981, "rank": 31.91441, "firstReward": 441, "repeatReward": 212, "layoutSeed": 46297, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 182, "pressure": 2.979 }, { "title": "Mill Road · E-183", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 21, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-183. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Mill Road · E-183.", "letter": "Mill Road · E-183. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 50, "id": 982, "rank": 31.94695, "firstReward": 441, "repeatReward": 212, "layoutSeed": 46334, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 183, "pressure": 2.981 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · E-184", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 7, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-184. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Assembly Point · E-184.", "letter": "Assembly Point · E-184. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 49, "id": 983, "rank": 31.97948, "firstReward": 437, "repeatReward": 210, "layoutSeed": 46371, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 184, "pressure": 2.983 }, { "title": "Observation Post · E-185", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 17, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-185. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Observation Post · E-185.", "letter": "Observation Post · E-185. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 49, "id": 984, "rank": 32.01201, "firstReward": 437, "repeatReward": 210, "layoutSeed": 46408, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 185, "pressure": 2.985 }, { "title": "The Return Address", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Protect the mail transport route", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "Sokolov writes his company's address on an envelope. For the first time in a long while, he believes a reply can find them. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Protect the mail transport route.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Return Address.”", "letter": "“The Return Address.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 47, "id": 985, "rank": 32.04454, "firstReward": 429, "repeatReward": 206, "legacyId": 147, "layoutSeed": 147, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 186, "pressure": 2.987 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · E-187", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 13, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-187. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Rations Depot · E-187.", "letter": "Rations Depot · E-187. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 47, "id": 986, "rank": 32.07708, "firstReward": 430, "repeatReward": 206, "layoutSeed": 46482, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 187, "pressure": 2.989 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · E-188", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 23, "weather": "ash", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-188. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Bridge Approach · E-188.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · E-188. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 46, "id": 987, "rank": 32.10961, "firstReward": 426, "repeatReward": 204, "layoutSeed": 46519, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 188, "pressure": 2.991 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · E-189", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 9, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector E-189. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Roadside Shelter · E-189.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · E-189. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 46, "id": 988, "rank": 32.14214, "firstReward": 426, "repeatReward": 204, "layoutSeed": 46556, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 189, "pressure": 2.993 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · E-190", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 19, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-190. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Kitchen · E-190.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · E-190. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 50, "id": 989, "rank": 32.17467, "firstReward": 442, "repeatReward": 212, "layoutSeed": 46593, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 190, "pressure": 2.995 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · E-191", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-191. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Supply Relay · E-191.", "letter": "Supply Relay · E-191. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 50, "id": 990, "rank": 32.20721, "firstReward": 442, "repeatReward": 212, "layoutSeed": 46630, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 191, "pressure": 2.997 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · E-192", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 15, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-192. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Clearing the Road · E-192.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · E-192. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 50, "id": 991, "rank": 32.23974, "firstReward": 442, "repeatReward": 213, "layoutSeed": 46667, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 192, "pressure": 2.999 }, { "title": "Until the Last Vehicle", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hold the final covering line", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "One vehicle still has to pass. Belov will not withdraw the positions: a promise must be kept to the very end. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Hold the final covering line.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “Until the Last Vehicle.”", "letter": "“Until the Last Vehicle.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 50, "id": 992, "rank": 32.27227, "firstReward": 443, "repeatReward": 213, "legacyId": 148, "layoutSeed": 148, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 193, "pressure": 3.001 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · E-194", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 23, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-194. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Hospital Bend · E-194.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · E-194. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 49, "id": 993, "rank": 32.3048, "firstReward": 439, "repeatReward": 211, "layoutSeed": 46741, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 194, "pressure": 3.003 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · E-195", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 9, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-195. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Roadside Crates · E-195.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · E-195. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 49, "id": 994, "rank": 32.33734, "firstReward": 439, "repeatReward": 211, "layoutSeed": 46778, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 195, "pressure": 3.005 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · E-196", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 19, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector E-196. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Timber Convoy · E-196.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · E-196. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 47, "id": 995, "rank": 32.36987, "firstReward": 431, "repeatReward": 207, "layoutSeed": 46815, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 196, "pressure": 3.007 }, { "title": "Courier Route · E-197", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-197. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Courier Route · E-197.", "letter": "Courier Route · E-197. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 47, "id": 996, "rank": 32.4024, "firstReward": 431, "repeatReward": 207, "layoutSeed": 46852, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 197, "pressure": 3.009 }, { "title": "Water Pump · E-198", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 15, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-198. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Water Pump · E-198.", "letter": "Water Pump · E-198. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 50, "id": 997, "rank": 32.43493, "firstReward": 443, "repeatReward": 213, "layoutSeed": 46889, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 198, "pressure": 3.011 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · E-199", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 1, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The mailbag is growing lighter, but the convoys still need a safe road. The company is keeping the promise made on the first day. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector E-199. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Repair Yard · E-199.", "letter": "Repair Yard · E-199. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 50, "id": 998, "rank": 32.46747, "firstReward": 444, "repeatReward": 213, "layoutSeed": 46926, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 199, "pressure": 3.013 }, { "title": "The Last Letter", "place": "Berlin", "date": "May 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 0, "weather": "ash", "trait": "final", "base": "Evacuation station", "quote": "“After the last shot, there is still work to do.”", "story": "Amid the last pockets of fighting, the company guards the evacuation road. The wounded and people from ruined streets pass along it. This is not a fight for a flag or building. Sokolov, Nina and Belov must do what the whole war taught them: keep a way open for those behind.", "objective": "Hold the last evacuation corridor.", "tip": "The final waves test your whole defence. Upgrade guns, support them with area fire, and use artillery carefully.", "outro": "The last vehicle passes. Belov packs his tools. Nina closes the empty mailbag and takes a blank sheet. Sokolov writes his first letter without asking anyone not to worry: “We are alive. Coming home.”", "letter": "We are alive. Coming home. We will tell you the rest when we get there.", "waves": 50, "id": 999, "rank": 32.5, "firstReward": 444, "repeatReward": 213, "legacyId": 149, "layoutSeed": 149, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 200, "pressure": 3.015 }] }, "de": { "version": 3, "campaignSize": 1000, "legacyMap": [0, 7, 14, 21, 27, 34, 41, 48, 55, 62, 69, 75, 82, 89, 96, 103, 110, 117, 124, 130, 137, 144, 151, 158, 165, 172, 178, 185, 192, 199, 200, 207, 214, 221, 227, 234, 241, 248, 255, 262, 269, 275, 282, 289, 296, 303, 310, 317, 324, 330, 337, 344, 351, 358, 365, 372, 378, 385, 392, 399, 400, 407, 414, 421, 427, 434, 441, 448, 455, 462, 469, 475, 482, 489, 496, 503, 510, 517, 524, 530, 537, 544, 551, 558, 565, 572, 578, 585, 592, 599, 600, 607, 614, 621, 627, 634, 641, 648, 655, 662, 669, 675, 682, 689, 696, 703, 710, 717, 724, 730, 737, 744, 751, 758, 765, 772, 778, 785, 792, 799, 800, 807, 814, 821, 827, 834, 841, 848, 855, 862, 869, 875, 882, 889, 896, 903, 910, 917, 924, 930, 937, 944, 951, 958, 965, 972, 978, 985, 992, 999], "chapters": [{ "name": "Zeit zum Rückzug", "years": "1941", "note": "Rette rechtzeitig die Menschen hinter uns.", "size": 200, "start": 0, "end": 199 }, { "name": "Standhalten lernen", "years": "1941–1942", "note": "Aus verstreuten Menschen wird eine Kompanie.", "size": 200, "start": 200, "end": 399 }, { "name": "Das Ufer der Hoffnung", "years": "1942–1943", "note": "Standhalten, wo die Straße endet.", "size": 200, "start": 400, "end": 599 }, { "name": "Der Weg zurück", "years": "1943", "note": "Dorthin zurückkehren, wo die Adressen geblieben sind.", "size": 200, "start": 600, "end": 799 }, { "name": "Briefe nach Hause", "years": "1944–1945", "note": "Das Versprechen des ersten Tages erfüllen.", "size": 200, "start": 800, "end": 999 }], "missions": [{ "title": "Die erste Stellung", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "training", "base": "Feldlazarett", "quote": "„Wir dachten, vor der Übung noch nach Hause schreiben zu können.“", "story": "Leutnant Alexei Sokolows Pioniere sollen die Straße zum Feldlazarett sichern. Die Verbindung zu den Nachbareinheiten ist abgebrochen. Funkerin Nina Wolkowa sucht nach einem Signal, während Feldwebel Michail Below aus den verbliebenen Vorräten eine Verteidigung aufbaut. Hinter ihnen werden die Verwundeten evakuiert. Jede Minute zählt.", "objective": "Halte die Lazarettstraße bis zum Ende der Evakuierung.", "tip": "MGs sind wirksam gegen Infanterie. An Kurven können sie Ziele länger beschießen.", "outro": "Der letzte Krankenwagen verschwindet im Wald. Nina hebt einen Postsack vom Straßenrand auf. Sokolow verspricht, die Briefe nicht zurückzulassen.", "letter": "Mutter, heute begriff ich den Wert einer ruhigen Minute. Wir schenkten sie Menschen, die nicht selbst gehen konnten.", "waves": 5, "id": 0, "rank": 0.0, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "legacyId": 0, "layoutSeed": 0, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 1, "pressure": 1.0 }, { "title": "Lazarettkurve · A-002", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Lazarettkurve", "quote": "", "story": "Die Kompanie lernt noch, beim Rückzug eine Straße zu halten. Hinter jeder Kreuzung warten Menschen, die Zeit brauchen. Späher melden Bewegung auf einem nahen Feldweg: Der Umweg ist nicht mehr sicher. Sokolow teilt die Feuerbereiche ein, während Below die Unterstände prüft. Abschnitt A-002. Abschnittsbefehl: Die Straße für die Sanitätswagen halten.", "objective": "Die Straße für die Sanitätswagen halten.", "tip": "Flächenfeuer mit Panzerabwehr kombinieren. Beschädigte Stellungen zwischen den Wellen reparieren; bezahlte Unterstützung ist nicht erforderlich.", "outro": "Die Linie hält. Die Kolonne passiert den Abschnitt ohne Halt. Lazarettkurve · A-002.", "letter": "Lazarettkurve · A-002. Heute bewachten wir keinen Kartenpunkt, sondern die Hoffnung eines Menschen auf Heimkehr.", "waves": 5, "id": 1, "rank": 0.03253, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10037, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 2, "pressure": 1.002 }, { "title": "Kisten am Weg · A-003", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Kisten am Weg", "quote": "", "story": "Die Kompanie lernt noch, beim Rückzug eine Straße zu halten. Hinter jeder Kreuzung warten Menschen, die Zeit brauchen. Späher melden Bewegung auf einem nahen Feldweg: Der Umweg ist nicht mehr sicher. Sokolow teilt die Feuerbereiche ein, während Below die Unterstände prüft. Abschnitt A-003. Abschnittsbefehl: Das Entladen der Munition am Feldweg schützen.", "objective": "Das Entladen der Munition am Feldweg schützen.", "tip": "Flächenfeuer mit Panzerabwehr kombinieren. Beschädigte Stellungen zwischen den Wellen reparieren; bezahlte Unterstützung ist nicht erforderlich.", "outro": "Die Linie hält. Die Kolonne passiert den Abschnitt ohne Halt. Kisten am Weg · A-003.", "letter": "Kisten am Weg · A-003. Heute bewachten wir keinen Kartenpunkt, sondern die Hoffnung eines Menschen auf Heimkehr.", "waves": 5, "id": 2, "rank": 0.06507, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10074, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 3, "pressure": 1.004 }, { "title": "Holzkolonne · A-004", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Holzkolonne", "quote": "", "story": "Die Kompanie lernt noch, beim Rückzug eine Straße zu halten. Hinter jeder Kreuzung warten Menschen, die Zeit brauchen. Das erste Fahrzeug ist liegen geblieben, und die Kolonne steht bis hinter die Kurve. Sokolow teilt die Feuerbereiche ein, während Below die Unterstände prüft. Abschnitt A-004. Abschnittsbefehl: Baumaterial durch eine gefährliche Kurve geleiten.", "objective": "Baumaterial durch eine gefährliche Kurve geleiten.", "tip": "Flächenfeuer mit Panzerabwehr kombinieren. Beschädigte Stellungen zwischen den Wellen reparieren; bezahlte Unterstützung ist nicht erforderlich.", "outro": "Die Linie hält. Die Kolonne passiert den Abschnitt ohne Halt. Holzkolonne · A-004.", "letter": "Holzkolonne · A-004. Heute bewachten wir keinen Kartenpunkt, sondern die Hoffnung eines Menschen auf Heimkehr.", "waves": 5, "id": 3, "rank": 0.0976, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10111, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 4, "pressure": 1.006 }, { "title": "Kurierroute · A-005", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Kurierroute", "quote": "", "story": "Die Kompanie lernt noch, beim Rückzug eine Straße zu halten. Hinter jeder Kreuzung warten Menschen, die Zeit brauchen. Das erste Fahrzeug ist liegen geblieben, und die Kolonne steht bis hinter die Kurve. Sokolow teilt die Feuerbereiche ein, während Below die Unterstände prüft. Abschnitt A-005. Abschnittsbefehl: Den Weg für Kuriere und Feldpost offen halten.", "objective": "Den Weg für Kuriere und Feldpost offen halten.", "tip": "Flächenfeuer mit Panzerabwehr kombinieren. Beschädigte Stellungen zwischen den Wellen reparieren; bezahlte Unterstützung ist nicht erforderlich.", "outro": "Die Linie hält. Die Funker melden: Die Route funktioniert wieder. Kurierroute · A-005.", "letter": "Kurierroute · A-005. Heute bewachten wir keinen Kartenpunkt, sondern die Hoffnung eines Menschen auf Heimkehr.", "waves": 5, "id": 4, "rank": 0.13013, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10148, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 5, "pressure": 1.008 }, { "title": "Wasserpumpe · A-006", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Wasserpumpe", "quote": "", "story": "Die Kompanie lernt noch, beim Rückzug eine Straße zu halten. Hinter jeder Kreuzung warten Menschen, die Zeit brauchen. Das erste Fahrzeug ist liegen geblieben, und die Kolonne steht bis hinter die Kurve. Sokolow teilt die Feuerbereiche ein, während Below die Unterstände prüft. Abschnitt A-006. Abschnittsbefehl: Das Beladen der Wasserwagen an der Pumpe ermöglichen.", "objective": "Das Beladen der Wasserwagen an der Pumpe ermöglichen.", "tip": "Flächenfeuer mit Panzerabwehr kombinieren. Beschädigte Stellungen zwischen den Wellen reparieren; bezahlte Unterstützung ist nicht erforderlich.", "outro": "Die Linie hält. Die Funker melden: Die Route funktioniert wieder. Wasserpumpe · A-006.", "letter": "Wasserpumpe · A-006. Below sagt, eine gute Stellung beginne mit der Sorge um die nächste Bedienung.", "waves": 6, "id": 5, "rank": 0.16266, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10185, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 6, "pressure": 1.01 }, { "title": "Reparaturhof · A-007", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Reparaturhof", "quote": "", "story": "Die Kompanie lernt noch, beim Rückzug eine Straße zu halten. Hinter jeder Kreuzung warten Menschen, die Zeit brauchen. Der Draht ist gerissen. Bis die Verbindung steht, richten sich die Bedienungen nach Signalflaggen. Sokolow teilt die Feuerbereiche ein, während Below die Unterstände prüft. Abschnitt A-007. Abschnittsbefehl: Den Reparaturhof bis zur Abfahrt des letzten Fahrzeugs verteidigen.", "objective": "Den Reparaturhof bis zur Abfahrt des letzten Fahrzeugs verteidigen.", "tip": "Flächenfeuer mit Panzerabwehr kombinieren. Beschädigte Stellungen zwischen den Wellen reparieren; bezahlte Unterstützung ist nicht erforderlich.", "outro": "Die Linie hält. Die Funker melden: Die Route funktioniert wieder. Reparaturhof · A-007.", "letter": "Reparaturhof · A-007. Below sagt, eine gute Stellung beginne mit der Sorge um die nächste Bedienung.", "waves": 6, "id": 6, "rank": 0.1952, "firstReward": 121, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10222, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 7, "pressure": 1.012 }, { "title": "Der Lazarettbrunnen", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Decke die Straße, während die Sanitäter ihre Fässer füllen", "quote": "„Hinter jeder Kurve wartet jemand auf unsere Hilfe.“", "story": "Den Sanitätern geht das Wasser aus. Below findet einen unbeschädigten Brunnen, doch der Weg dorthin liegt offen. Die Kompanie befestigt die Straße. Jede gewonnene Minute hilft, den Auftrag zu erfüllen.", "objective": "Decke die Straße, während die Sanitäter ihre Fässer füllen.", "tip": "MGs und Mörser halten dichte Gruppen auf. Stelle sie an eine lange Kurve.", "outro": "Die Linie hält. Im Tagebuch steht: „Der Lazarettbrunnen — Auftrag erfüllt.“ Nina legt es behutsam neben den Postsack.", "letter": "„Der Lazarettbrunnen.“ Wieder haben wir fremde Hoffnung beschützt. Vielleicht entsteht aus solchen kleinen Taten der Heimweg.", "waves": 6, "id": 7, "rank": 0.22773, "firstReward": 121, "repeatReward": 50, "legacyId": 1, "layoutSeed": 1, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 8, "pressure": 1.014 }, { "title": "Draht durch den Wald · A-009", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Draht durch den Wald", "quote": "", "story": "Die Kompanie lernt noch, beim Rückzug eine Straße zu halten. Hinter jeder Kreuzung warten Menschen, die Zeit brauchen. Der Draht ist gerissen. Bis die Verbindung steht, richten sich die Bedienungen nach Signalflaggen. Nina markiert sichere Kurven auf der Karte und funkt einen kurzen Befehl. Abschnitt A-009. Abschnittsbefehl: Das Verlegen einer neuen Telefonleitung decken.", "objective": "Das Verlegen einer neuen Telefonleitung decken.", "tip": "Flächenfeuer mit Panzerabwehr kombinieren. Beschädigte Stellungen zwischen den Wellen reparieren; bezahlte Unterstützung ist nicht erforderlich.", "outro": "Die Linie hält. Pioniere räumen die Sperren für die eigenen Fahrzeuge. Draht durch den Wald · A-009.", "letter": "Draht durch den Wald · A-009. Below sagt, eine gute Stellung beginne mit der Sorge um die nächste Bedienung.", "waves": 6, "id": 8, "rank": 0.26026, "firstReward": 121, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10296, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 9, "pressure": 1.016 }, { "title": "Pionierpatrouille · A-010", "place": "Westgrenze", "date": "Juni 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 18, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Pionierpatrouille", "quote": "", "story": "Die Kompanie lernt noch, beim Rückzug eine Straße zu halten. Hinter jeder Kreuzung warten Menschen, die Zeit brauchen. Die Nachtpatrouille bringt eine Skizze eines neuen feindlichen Anmarschwegs. Nina markiert sichere Kurven auf der Karte und funkt einen kurzen Befehl. Abschnitt A-010. Abschnittsbefehl: Die Straße halten, während Pioniere den nächsten Abschnitt prüfen.", "objective": "Die Straße halten, während Pioniere den nächsten Abschnitt prüfen.", "tip": "Flächenfeuer mit Panzerabwehr kombinieren. Beschädigte Stellungen zwischen den Wellen reparieren; bezahlte Unterstützung ist nicht erforderlich.", "outro": "Die Linie hält. Pioniere räumen die Sperren für die e